{"unit_id":"tag:09AY:proof","translation":"条件 (1) 蕴含<MATH_0001>的底拓扑空间（topological space）为预有限（profinite）的，见代数（Algebra）引理<REF_0001>。因此阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）在拓扑空间（topological space）<MATH_0002>上的高阶上同调群（cohomology groups）（即 Zariski 上同调（cohomology））平凡，见上同调（Cohomology）引理<REF_0002>。局部环（local rings）由代数（Algebra）引理<REF_0003>均严格 Hensel（strictly henselian）。于是平展上同调（<ACCENT_0001>tale cohomology）对于<MATH_0003>由 Zariski 上同调（cohomology）计算，这是引理<REF_0004>的结果，证明完毕。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski","Hensel"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"topological space","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"profinite","target_term":"预有限"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"topological space","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"Cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"local rings","target_term":"局部环"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"strictly henselian","target_term":"严格 Hensel"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale cohomology","target_term":"平展上同调"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"topological space","target_term":"拓扑空间","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"profinite","target_term":"预有限","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"引用章节暂译。"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"Cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"引用章节暂译。"},{"source_term":"local rings","target_term":"局部环","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"strictly henselian","target_term":"严格 Hensel","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale cohomology","target_term":"平展上同调","context":"待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0EZN:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n绝对整闭（absolutely integrally closed）环（ring）的谱（spectrum）提供了概形（scheme）的一个例子，其所有局部环（local rings）均严格 Hensel（strictly henselian），见代数进阶（More on Algebra）引理<REF_0001>。事实上，正规（normal）整环（domains）若其分式域（fraction fields）可分闭（separably closed），就有更强的性质，如下一引理所述。\n\n","allowed_english":["Hensel"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"absolutely integrally closed","target_term":"绝对整闭"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"spectrum","target_term":"谱"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"local rings","target_term":"局部环"},{"source_term":"strictly henselian","target_term":"严格 Hensel"},{"source_term":"More on Algebra","target_term":"代数进阶"},{"source_term":"normal","target_term":"正规"},{"source_term":"domains","target_term":"整环"},{"source_term":"fraction fields","target_term":"分式域"},{"source_term":"separably closed","target_term":"可分闭"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"absolutely integrally closed","target_term":"绝对整闭","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"spectrum","target_term":"谱","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"local rings","target_term":"局部环","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"strictly henselian","target_term":"严格 Hensel","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"More on Algebra","target_term":"代数进阶","context":"引用章节暂译。"},{"source_term":"normal","target_term":"正规","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"domains","target_term":"整环","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"fraction fields","target_term":"分式域","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"separably closed","target_term":"可分闭","context":"待决。"}],"notes":[]}
